    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>What curators say</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/horrornetwork.JPG?t=1753484011\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/haveaword.JPG?t=1753484011\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging, gory, intense!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way through a hostile urban environment, avoid getting killed by authorities and prepare for anything, even corpses coming back to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You probably should have stayed home, but it's too late for that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/43280cb410c4aadf17c0a0536d793b9e.poster.avif?t=1753484011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/43280cb410c4aadf17c0a0536d793b9e.webm?t=1753484011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/43280cb410c4aadf17c0a0536d793b9e.mp4?t=1753484011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die and retry mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 30-60 minute experience that can be completed in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich (but dangerous!), detailed environment for players who love exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret endings, including a specific one for speed-runners!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging, gory, intense!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way through a hostile urban environment, avoid getting killed by authorities and prepare for anything, even corpses coming back to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You probably should have stayed home, but it's too late for that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/43280cb410c4aadf17c0a0536d793b9e.poster.avif?t=1753484011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/43280cb410c4aadf17c0a0536d793b9e.webm?t=1753484011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336420/extras/43280cb410c4aadf17c0a0536d793b9e.mp4?t=1753484011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die and retry mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 30-60 minute experience that can be completed in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich (but dangerous!), detailed environment for players who love exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret endings, including a specific one for speed-runners!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "short_description": "A short &quot;die &amp; retry&quot; horror survival. You were supposed to follow the lockdown instructions but when you receive that desperate phone call from Jenny, you can't just ignore her. Try to survive and rescue your friend in a burning city.",
